# GitHub asks the maintainers for a review when a pull request touches the CI, the CLA checker,
# the agreement or the lists of signatories and maintainers. The branch rule of `main` does not
# require that review: the maintainers read such changes before merging.
# GitHub reads account names here; CONTRIBUTORS.md lists the maintainers by name, and
# tools/cla-check/MAINTAINERS holds their commit addresses. The three change together.
/.github/              @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
/tools/cla-check/      @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
/CLA.md                @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
/CLA-SIGNATORIES.md    @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
/CONTRIBUTORS.md       @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
/.gitattributes        @mathiasbourgoin @julien-atacama @igarnier
